--- !u!114 &3701291283526916286
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2634317550568746512}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e334c5a5dee7ebf4bb00e7429321183d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueLines:
  - 'Stranger: Welcome BOY!!! I have been waiting for you...'
  - 'Traveler: a a.. and who are you supposed to be?'
  - 'Rage: I am one of your many ancestors my name is Rage, I heard the news that
    you are looking for The Answer..'
  - 'Traveler: yes I am looking for my purpose in life so how can I get The Answer?'
  - 'Rage: First let me tell you my story from when I was well and alive..'
  - 'Rage: I was born at a time where being poor was all what people knew, no one
    knew the taste of food, food was so rare to come accross that we started eating
    bugs to survive..'
  - 'Rage: I grew up in a loving family, or at least so I thought, we were taught
    since being born that all we have is each other and no matter what we always
    have each others back..'
  - 'Rage: until one day my mom heard of a king who ruled the world, he was promising
    a wealthy happy life to whoever has the heart to sacrifice their kid to be a
    worker at his mansion...'
  - 'Rage: and for the first time since I saw the light, I looked into my mom eyes
    and they were lit up with hope, she looked at me and without hesitation she told
    me: Finally, Finally there will be a use of you...'
  - 'Rage: I wasn''t hurt from it I was just angry I was furious, I was angry at
    the world for not having enough resources for humans, I was angry at the king
    who was separating families and taking advantage of the world...'
  - 'Rage: and the person i was the most angry at is me my self because if i was
    just strong enough i could have ended that king kingdom and set free the millions
    of people he was enslaving...'
  - 'Rage: and now for you to find your Answer you will have to defeat me and face
    the Rage of a thousand years!'
  - 'Traveler: I would do anything to get The Answer so: BRING IT ON RAGE!!!'
  dialogueText: {fileID: 0}
